      "comment": "BROKEN HALO (1) was a winner two back and strongly fancied last time but could only manage fifth (26.71) at Warragul. Better than last start and worth following up. KRAKEN GINGER (7) was never in contention last time after missing the jump at The Meadows, but prior to that won easily by 4.5 lengths at Bendigo (27.80) beating Erase And Rewind in a Restricted WIN H on August 21. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Warrants plenty of respect. PAW MADDISON (2) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (29.94) at Sandown in a Mix 6/7. Expected to do much better this time. WESTAR LEO (5) has top-three aspirations after placing from this box last time.",
